{
 "_readme": "Builder Base dataset: per-Builder-Hall counts and ceilings, footprints, build currency, and EXACT cost and build time for every level. Unlike the Home Village table in src/lib/game/buildings.ts, nothing here is interpolated - the wiki publishes every Builder Base level individually, so every number is anchored and no value is an estimate.",
 "_source": "https://clashofclans.fandom.com - each entry records the page it came from.",
 "_derivation": "Counts and ceilings per Builder Hall come from the Builder Hall page's own tables; costs, times and footprints from each structure's or troop's page. The two agree: a structure's highest priced level equals its ceiling at Builder Hall 10. Troop ceilings are derived from the Star Laboratory level each level requires (Star Laboratory level equals Builder Hall level), and unlocks from the Builder Barracks level that unlocks the troop. A unit or structure that unlocks late arrives part-levelled - the Electrofire Wizard is given at level 17, not 1 - so startLevel records the level it arrives at, and every level at or below it is null rather than a zero-cost step.",
